      {
        "variation": "default",
        "version": "initial",
        "items": [],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "Musicians first",
          "title": "Organs that play with feeling",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A traditional organ hits every drum with the same force, and every pipe is simply on or off. On a Decap organ the drumstick hits hard or soft, the wind pressure changes per wind chest, ranks play vibrato and the whole organ is volume-controllable. smARTvalve takes this down to every single pipe.",
              "spans": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "That is why a Decap organ fits a living room as well as a theatre stage or a DJ set. With traditional mechanical technology it would not be possible.",
              "spans": []
            }
          ],
          "image": {
            "dimensions": {
              "width": 1448,
              "height": 1086
            },
            "alt": null,
            "copyright": null,
            "url": "https://images.prismic.io/decap/NqF31ts0KK3QXxJN_Untitleddesign-10-.png?auto=format,compress",
